{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK17SupportedVersionsO22isSwiftSixLanguageModeSbvpZ","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"roleHeading":"Type Property"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions\/isswiftsixlanguagemode"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when built by a 6.0+ toolchain, which selects "},{"code":"Package@swift-6.0.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its per-target language-mode setting. Reported rather than assumed, because the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"difference is invisible from the outside and decides whether the concurrency"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"guarantees were checked or merely intended."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This reads the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"language mode","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", not the toolchain: "},{"code":"#if swift(>=6.0)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" tests the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"former and "},{"code":"#if compiler(>=6.0)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the latter, and they genuinely differ in this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"package. On a 6.x toolchain the library and the examples are built in Swift 6"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode while the test target is deliberately still built in Swift 5 mode — the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"library and examples compile clean under full strict-concurrency checking and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"test harness does not, so scoping the mode to the targets that actually ship is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what makes the guarantee about the artifact you get rather than about a rewrite of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the test suite."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"this library"}]},{"type":"text","text":" was compiled in Swift 6 language mode."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SupportedVersions":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions","title":"SupportedVersions","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SupportedVersions","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SupportedVersions","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The range of Swift versions this SDK is built and tested against."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","role":"collection","title":"AxiamSDK","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SupportedVersions/isSwiftSixLanguageMode":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions\/isswiftsixlanguagemode","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/isSwiftSixLanguageMode","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"this library"}]},{"type":"text","text":" was compiled in Swift 6 language mode."}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}]}}}